{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2023-04-19 07:00:00', 'title': 'BROADRIDGE AND LINEDATA ANNOUNCE INTEGRATION WITH LINEDATA LONGVIEW OMS TO ENHANCE TRADE MATCHING', 'text': "DRIVING GREATER CUSTOMER VALUE THROUGH A SINGLE MULTI-ASSET CLASS POST-TRADE MATCHING PLATFORM, LEVERAGING FIX NEW YORK , APRIL 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TO BETTER AUTOMATE THE MIDDLE AND BACK-OFFICE FUNCTIONS AROUND TRADE MATCHING, GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER, BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC. (NYSE: BR), TODAY ANNOUNCED AN EXPANSION OF ITS PARTNERSHIP WITH LINEDATA,\xa0A GLOBAL PROVIDER OF ASSET MANAGEMENT AND CREDIT TECHNOLOGY DATA AND SERVICES. THROUGH THIS EXPANDED GLOBAL PARTNERSHIP, BROADRIDGE'S NYFIX MATCHING SOLUTION WILL BE INTEGRATED DIRECTLY WITH LINEDATA'S ORDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM (OMS) POWERED BY ITS ASSET MANAGEMENT PLATFORM (AMP)."}